    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "This simple model yields some interesting features. Assuming that the absolute value of m is less than one, which is necessary for the phenotypic variance to equilibrate, the covariance between mother and offspring is",
      "source_page": 719,
      "printed_page": 699,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter23:p021:b7"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        67.0,
        557.0,
