      "content_sha256": "dcf412949fb8127513e081644725a2bad55ff9feda515d59f927fb0634a6edf0"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Thus, Falconer’s m is identical to the m that we defined in Example 1. In terms of the covariance components of Wilham’s model, Equation 23.1,",
      "source_page": 720,
      "printed_page": 700,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter23:p022:b2"
      ],
      "bbox": [
